Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 21:52:13 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 07/11] Add lightweight guest FPS overlay statistics

shiftglue port: shiftglue moved the guest-output publish step into
PublishGuestOutput(), so the frame is recorded at the end of
RefreshGuestOutput() next to `return is_active`; presenter.h keeps both
the publish deferrer and the frame-stats tracker.
